ull,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-11-10T07:45:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:30:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/1444","html_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1444","diff_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1444.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1444.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds `tasks/set-a-rat-trap-without-a-gripper-in-its-strike-path/`: Set the rat trap without ever letting its hammer snap. With one hand, pull the steel hammer up and over to the near end of the trap and hold it there. With the other, swing the lock bar forward over the hammer and press its tip down into the brass catch. Keep every gripper out of the hammer's path until the lock bar is latched, unless that gripper is holding the hammer back. Then let the hammer settle against the lock bar, never touch the yellow trigger pedal of the set trap, and take both arms back to where they started.\n\n- `set_a_rat_trap_without_a_gripper_in_its_strike_path.py`: the `yam_arena` task file (scene, `success()`, `score()` and a scripted `demo()`)\n- `task.json`: media `M-QRR9N3` (Dream-1 run, scripted demo, setup screenshot)\n- `README.md`: commands to run and score a trial, runtime per trial, seeds\n\nScores: Dream-1 run: 0.0; demo: 1.0.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1444/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}